TITLE Equilibrium of pure water with CO2 gas, check SI of CH4(g)

SOLUTION 1 Pure water at pH 7.0, 25 C
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    redox     pe
    units     mol/kgw
    density   1.0
    water     1.0  # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g)   -3.4   10.0   # log PCO2 = -3.4, 10 moles available

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     result.out
    -reset    false
    -si       CH4(g)

END
